---
description: Prefer fix-only verification; avoid full production builds unless asked
alwaysApply: true
---

# Builds & verification

- If the user says **do not make build** / **only fix**: fix the issue and verify with `tsc`/lint or a focused check — **never** run a full `npm run build` unless they ask.
- After type errors: fix types properly; avoid sprawling `as any` unless matching an established local pattern.
- Don't commit or push unless explicitly requested.
